@startuml K-AI能力中心
' 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 L3 · K AI 能力中心（UC-SUB-K-01 ~ K-06）
title 民生甄选 · 子系统用例图 · K AI 能力中心
left to right direction

skinparam actorStyle awesome
skinparam rectangle {
  BackgroundColor #F4F6FB
  BorderColor #5B7DB1
}
skinparam usecase {
  BackgroundColor #EAF2FB
  BorderColor #3E6AA8
}
skinparam note {
  BackgroundColor #FFFDE7
  BorderColor #C9B458
}

actor "商户" as MERCHANT
actor "供应商" as SUPPLIER
actor "监管人员" as REGU
actor "消费者" as CONSUMER
actor "平台运营方" as OPER

rectangle "K AI 能力中心" {
  usecase "UC-SUB-K-01 OCR 核验证照" as K01
  usecase "UC-SUB-K-02 统一 AI 网关与治理" as K02
  usecase "UC-SUB-K-03 审核视觉合规图片" as K03
  usecase "UC-SUB-K-04 图像问答答疑" as K04
  usecase "UC-SUB-K-05 识别后厨直播异常" as K05
  usecase "UC-SUB-K-06 预测并预警风险商户" as K06
}

MERCHANT --> K01
MERCHANT --> K05
SUPPLIER --> K01
REGU --> K01
REGU --> K03
REGU --> K05
REGU --> K06
CONSUMER --> K04
OPER --> K02

note bottom of K01
  入驻核验（A-01/T-01）include OCR 预审（跨模块）
end note
note bottom of K05
  联动 B-02 后厨直播；需商户授权；处置监管人工确认
end note
@enduml
